WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Open the Calendar

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.600
Touch and hold, then drag it

3
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.100
Moved — Undo is in the banner

4
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.600
Tap the block…

5
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.100
…Remove from Plan — only the time block goes; the task itself is kept

6
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.600
Undo puts it back

7
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:37.100
Back on the plan
